# Debug log setiap RPC baru

Setiap **RPC baru** atau **handler gRPC baru** di `service.rs`, wajib log debug saat selesai (sukses atau error).

## Format (wajib)

```
{nama_rpc} {nama_user} {elapsed_ms}ms
```

Contoh output:

```
GetStockByCode Baki 12ms
UpdateCatatanOwner Andi 3ms
Login anonymous 45ms
```

- **nama_rpc** — nama method gRPC PascalCase (sama dengan di `.proto`), mis. `GetStockByCode`
- **nama_user** — `AuthSession.nama` bila RPC butuh login; bila tidak ada auth gunakan `anonymous` (Login: bisa pakai email request)
- **elapsed_ms** — durasi handler dari awal sampai return, bulatkan `as_millis()` (integer)

Gunakan `eprintln!` agar masuk ke log server (`invezgood.log` via PM2).

## Pola implementasi (Rust / tonic)

```rust
async fn get_stock_by_code(
    &self,
    request: Request<GetStockByCodeRequest>,
) -> Result<Response<StockByCodeResponse>, Status> {
    let started = std::time::Instant::now();
    let rpc_name = "GetStockByCode";

    let auth = self.require_auth(&request).await?;
    let user_name = auth.nama.as_str();

    let code = request.into_inner().code.trim().to_ascii_uppercase();
    // ... logic handler ...

    let result = Ok(Response::new(/* ... */));

    eprintln!(
        "{rpc_name} {user_name} {}ms",
        started.elapsed().as_millis()
    );
    result
}
```

## Auth helper

- RPC **protected** (metadata `authorization: Bearer <token>`): `require_auth` harus mengembalikan `AuthSession` (bukan hanya `()`) supaya `nama` tersedia.
- RPC **publik** (`Login`, `Ping`, dll.): log dengan `anonymous` atau identifier request yang relevan.

## Wajib di setiap return path

Log **selalu** dieksekusi sebelum return — termasuk error (`invalid_argument`, `not_found`, `internal`). Pola aman:

```rust
let started = std::time::Instant::now();
let rpc_name = "MyRpc";
let user_name = "...";

let result: Result<Response<_>, Status> = async {
    // body handler
}.await;

eprintln!(
    "{rpc_name} {user_name} {}ms",
    started.elapsed().as_millis()
);
result
```

Atau helper crate-level:

```rust
fn log_rpc_debug(rpc_name: &str, user_name: &str, started: std::time::Instant) {
    eprintln!(
        "{rpc_name} {user_name} {}ms",
        started.elapsed().as_millis()
    );
}
```

## Jangan anggap selesai bila

- Handler RPC baru tanpa `eprintln!` debug
- Format log tidak persis `{rpc} {user} {N}ms`
- Durasi tidak diukur (`Instant::now()` + `elapsed()`)
